{{!
    @template mod_scormmakercmi5/report_user

    Detail of one learner in the report (R7, R4.8): status of the course, grade, and each assignable unit of the
    package version of the registration with its status (text and icon) and, for those who manage attempts, a link
    to waive it; links to the statements of the learner and to delete the attempt.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * learner - Full name of the learner, plain text.
    * coursestatus - Status of the course (HTML from the renderer: icon and escaped label).
    * grade - Grade, plain text ("-" when there is none).
    * hasaus - Whether there is any unit.
    * aus - Units; each has title (plain text), status (HTML from the renderer), waivedreason (plain text, '' when not
      waived) and waiveurl ('' when the unit cannot be waived by the viewer).
    * canmanage - Whether the viewer manages attempts (Actions column).
    * statementsurl - URL of the statements of the learner ('' without attempt).
    * deleteurl - URL of the attempt deletion page ('' without attempt or without manageattempts).
    * reporturl - URL of the report.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "learner": "Student One",
        "coursestatus": "<span class=\"mod-scormmakercmi5-status\" data-state=\"inprogress\">In progress</span>",
        "grade": "80.00",
        "hasaus": true,
        "aus": [
            {"title": "Unit 1", "status": "<span>Waived</span>", "waivedreason": "Administrative", "waiveurl": ""},
            {"title": "Unit 2", "status": "<span>Not started</span>", "waivedreason": "",
             "waiveurl": "https://example.com/mod/scormmakercmi5/waive.php?id=1&userid=2&au=3"}
        ],
        "canmanage": true,
        "statementsurl": "https://example.com/mod/scormmakercmi5/report.php?id=1&mode=statements&userid=2",
        "deleteurl": "https://example.com/mod/scormmakercmi5/attempt_delete.php?id=1&userid=2",
        "reporturl": "https://example.com/mod/scormmakercmi5/report.php?id=1"
    }
}}
<div class="mod-scormmakercmi5-reportuser">
    <h3>{{learner}}</h3>
    <dl class="row">
        <dt class="col-sm-3">{{#str}} reportcoursestatus, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">{{{coursestatus}}}</dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3">{{#str}} reportgrade, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">{{grade}}</dd>
    </dl>
    {{#hasaus}}
    <table class="generaltable mod-scormmakercmi5-aus">
        <caption>{{#str}} aus, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</caption>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th scope="col">{{#str}} autitle, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</th>
                <th scope="col">{{#str}} austatus, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</th>
                {{#canmanage}}<th scope="col">{{#str}} auactions, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</th>{{/canmanage}}
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {{#aus}}
            <tr>
                <th scope="row">{{title}}</th>
                <td>{{{status}}}{{#waivedreason}} <span class="text-muted">({{waivedreason}})</span>{{/waivedreason}}</td>
                {{#canmanage}}
                <td>
                    {{#waiveurl}}<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{waiveurl}}">{{#str}} waivesubmit, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}<span class="accesshide"> {{title}}</span></a>{{/waiveurl}}
                </td>
                {{/canmanage}}
            </tr>
            {{/aus}}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    {{/hasaus}}
    <div class="mod-scormmakercmi5-actions">
        {{#statementsurl}}<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{statementsurl}}">{{#str}} reportviewstatements, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</a>{{/statementsurl}}
        {{#deleteurl}}<a class="btn btn-danger" href="{{deleteurl}}">{{#str}} deleteattempt, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</a>{{/deleteurl}}
        <a class="btn btn-link" href="{{reporturl}}">{{#str}} reportback, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</a>
    </div>
</div>
